contentText:
Miami is gearing up for an eventful 2026 Billboard Latin Music Week, returning to the Faena Forum from Oct. 19 to 22.&nbsp;

More than 25 artist and industry panels are confirmed, including the coveted Superstar Q&As that this year include intimate and candid conversations with Anuel AA, Becky G, Fuerza Regida, Kany García, Maluma, Pitbull, and Ruben Blades.&nbsp;

Amongst the many speakers are Rawayana, who will talk about their massive touring year with ¿Dónde es el after? ; Trueno, Quevedo & Kidd Voodoo, who will speak on the new urban movement; and for the first time, a panel on reparto music, featuring Cuba’s hottest music stars Bebeshito, Wow Popy, DJ Conds, Rey Tony and Helabusador. As well as the popular franchises such as the Women’s and Regional Mexican panels.

