But the fun doesn’t end there. Following a day of key conversations and networking sessions, Latin Music Week will host a wave of showcases, including two Billboard En Vivo Concerts: Fuerza Regida on Tuesday, and Jay Wheeler and Zhamira on Wednesday.

For the first time in Latin Music Week history, Billboard is also teaming up with Eater for El Pre-Party, an evening celebrating Miami’s vibrant music and food scene. El Pre-Party will include salsa dancing lessons from Lenny Tavárez and his wife, Natasha Nazario, as well as special performances by Tavárez, Anthony Ramos and Micro TDH, and a DJ set by EP The Latino.

